			<div class="content" id="post-content-1586627">
									

<p>Gotta agree with the others that this reads more like an Anomalous Item than a SCP:</p>
<p>&quot;Item is a red, helium-filled balloon. When untethered, it will drift towards the closest group of at least 4 people, who are in a &quot;happy mood&quot;. Once within 4.5 meters of the group, each individual will gradually exhibit more manic behaviors, apparently due to increased mood. This includes an increased willingness to engage in a wide array of pleasurable activites, regardless of outside stimuli or appropriateness. The effects will continue for a maximum of 2 hours after initial exposure to the balloon, or if the group within range drops below 4 people.&quot;</p>
<p>There. Total effects of the balloon summarized into a short paragraph.</p>

