														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-1587605">
									

<p>I really like this one. It's anomalous, it's fairly subtle, and honestly it creeps me out without doing a single thing that's even slightly malevolent. A possibly-sentient balloon that doesn't drift in the breeze but can move on its own? I don't care if it wants to cheer me up, it's still creepy. Its simple existence would mean we definitely don't fully understand the universe yet and I imagine the Foundation would want to learn what it could from Mr. Happy Fun-times Balloon.</p>
<p>+1 for a simple and effective item.</p>
<p>One quick nit-pick: &quot;humanoid voices&quot; doesn't make sense. While the suffix &quot;-oid&quot; can be translated as &quot;-like,&quot; thus making humanoid mean &quot;human-like,&quot; this word is referring specifically to form or shape. Because a voice doesn't take a shape, you can't have a human-shaped voice.</p>

							</div>

								
					
